1
00:00:00,295 --> 00:00:02,385
Long story short, she's on the no-fly list...

2
00:00:02,564 --> 00:00:04,964
(Bernadette:)...and we might have been
followed here by a drone.

3
00:00:06,101 --> 00:00:10,401
- I'm sorry. I feel like such an idiot.
- Oh, it's not so bad. You lost money...

4
00:00:10,572 --> 00:00:15,232
...you're filled with shame, you got groped
by a stranger. That's Vegas, you nailed it.

5
00:00:16,144 --> 00:00:19,804
(Amy:)You guys enjoy your evening. I'm gonna go
before I ruin anybody else's weekend.

6
00:00:20,015 --> 00:00:22,345
(Sheldon:)That's my girl.

7
00:00:24,419 --> 00:00:27,619
(Leonard:)Amy, wait. I know it's not the night
you had in mind...

8
00:00:27,823 --> 00:00:30,083
...but why don't you stay and play?
It'll be fun.

9
00:00:30,525 --> 00:00:31,585
(Sheldon:)Fun?

10
00:00:31,760 --> 00:00:34,090
(Sheldon:)Three weeks ago you bought
crunchy peanut butter...

11
00:00:34,262 --> 00:00:37,862
(Sheldon:)...now you want the girls to play D&D
with... Do you have a drug problem?

12
00:00:38,767 --> 00:00:42,137
(Leonard:)What's the big deal? Raj bailed,
so we could use some extra players.

13
00:00:42,304 --> 00:00:45,334
(Sheldon:)I've just never played
Dungeons & Dragons with girls before.

14
00:00:45,507 --> 00:00:48,037
(Penny:)Oh, don't worry, sweetie. No one has.

15
00:00:51,379 --> 00:00:52,639
(Leonard:)So, what do you say?

16
00:00:54,883 --> 00:00:58,023
(Sheldon:)I'll leave it up to the Dungeon Master.

